  TECHNIQUES KEPT AND STATED ONCE. (1) THE BRING-UP LADDER (lessons L1, L6, L7).
  execute_attempt_loop gains a tier-0 activity ahead of the tier-1 fingerprint check:
  once per tip, five uncharged rungs recorded in the attempt log before the serving
  grant - (a) the declared test paths collect and pass on the tip (the changeset's
