  agree bit for bit; a feature port still gets a served-output gate of its own kind;
  tensor comparators stay as diagnostics because localization needs them. P9 is
  untouched. Cost per run: none. User-only change touched: root acceptance and check
  strength (stronger).

  (4) THE WHOLE-TREE TWO-LEG TEST RECORD (lesson L6). changeset_complete asks for a
  fifth component - the declared test paths collected and run whole-tree on the tip,
  zero collection errors and zero new failures against the target base, a quarantined
  item carrying its import proof - and names class (e), a collection error or a new
  failure, as the defect; scope_next_increment's assembly and class list and
  realize_increment's coverage-gap list name the component and its re-run in one
  clause each. Evidence: LEAD-LOG 2190 - four of five vendored upstream test files
  never imported at the pin since commit 13ec071, 13 stale tests failing at head and
  base, 28 quarantined items, all found on day 24 by one two-leg pass. Why general: no
  CI runs the fork's tests, so the changeset is the only place a collection error is
  measured before hardware spend. Cost per run: one whole-tree CPU-mode collection and
  run per plan_satisfied round, the pass a fold item already pays. User-only change
  touched: check strength (stronger).

  (5) A NO-BEHAVIOR-CHANGE CLAIM IS DECIDED BY A DIFF TOOL. review_increment_batch's
  material list gains one clause: a claim of no behavior change is decided by an AST
  or token diff of the touched functions, never by reading. Evidence: the technique
  caught false "refactor only" claims in the batch reviews that produced 92 material
  findings (lessons file, "What paid for itself"). Why general: a reviewer reading a
  large diff for equivalence is the fakeable evidence pave-spec 9.14.1 ranks below a
  tool the doer does not run. Cost: none - it replaces reading with a command.

  (6) MEASUREMENT OUTCOME APART FROM HYGIENE (lesson L7, usage record item 4).
  hardware_attempt_log's subject: a run record's measurement outcome stands apart from
  hygiene findings on the host after it, which never set the outcome. Evidence:
  attempt 25's driver recorded outcome=failed on a device-handle census two seconds
  after SIGTERM while 200 of 200 rows were served and passed (ruling 71, debt
  D-HOST-FD-CENSUS-RACE). Cost: none; not weaker.

  (7) THE LEAD'S RECORD (lesson L4). One principle: the lead writes run state, the
  user's decision record, and the records the workflow names it the writer of (the
  cross-run artifacts at closure, the plan bookkeeping edits, the changeset assembly),
  and keeps no log of its own; a row names a declared outcome and points at evidence;
  an event inside a node is the seat's record at its evidence path; a ruling a seat
  needs lives once, in the round record or outcome row of the node it decides. The
  evidence is the run-level ceremony listed above. Cost: negative. Not user-only.

  (8) STANDING APPROVAL AND THE WRITE BOUNDARY (lesson L5, graph half). The user role
  says a standing approval is the user's verbatim line with the scope it names and the
  lead never widens one by reading intent; scope.out names any write outside the run's
  artifact tree, the campaign worktrees and branches, and the fork - the workflow's
  own package, the harness configuration and memory included - as user-owned.
  Evidence: DECISIONS 12 (2026-09-05, "approve stop asking for my approval, make the
  most aligned decisions", read by the lead as delegation of frozen-value changes and
  package releases) to DECISIONS 728 (2026-09-08, revoked): 3.5 days, two plugin
  releases into the pave repository reverted, memory files that widened the lead's
  authority. The mechanical half - write_limits deny globs bound to the lead - is the
  kind run_setup companion, revision 16. User-only change touched: state authority and
  forbidden effects.

  (9) AN ERRATUM PATH FOR A VERDICT'S PROSE (usage record item 5). adjudicate_results:
  a verdict's prose is corrected only by an erratum the adjudicator appends to the
  verdict record, naming the line and the evidence; a value or the consequence never
  moves by erratum. Evidence: ruling 73 and an erratum seat filled this by hand. Why
  not an outcome: it routes nowhere. Actor: the adjudicator, who owns the record.

  EVERY RETAINED CHECK AND THE DEFECT IT CATCHES (fifteen; the five touched checks
  name it in their question, the ten untouched already do, in the question or its
  rationale): kickoff_contract_approved - a tensor gate measuring the stack;
