changelog_entry: >-
  Graph revision 15 (`history/v15.patch`, kind graph): what the GLM-5.3-Flash port
  taught - ceremony out, the techniques that caught defects stated once. Cut: the
  never-fired prerequisite hold (one outcome, edge and check); the eight-round design
  bound with its repair-introduced labeling (now fewer than four rounds); the
